    "detailed_description": "<h1>Also recommended for you</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1676154409\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Six Faces | Overpower</h2>Step up to the challenge and test your skills with responsive controls and extremely difficult puzzles. Six faces, four powers (\ud83d\ude80,\ud83d\udce6,\ud83d\udca3,\u2693). Easy to learn, hard to master, with 64 hand-drawn puzzles to solve. Unleash your creativity and dive into a world of fun with tons of alternate mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Effortless and Engaging Controls for Maximum Fun: Enjoy a game that's easy to play and responsive.<br></li><li> Explore multiple visuals from different worlds<br></li><li> Challenging Combinations of Different Powers: Learn and feel challenged with unique powers and their incredible combinations.<br></li><li> Innovative Mechanics that Make the Game Even More Fun and Exciting<br></li><li> Solve All 64 Hand-Drawn Puzzles (if You Can).</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Powers</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOOK</h2>Reach distant places, pull objects, and more<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/3a74ece811f601316e856b9ca66b4bfb.poster.avif?t=1676154409\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/3a74ece811f601316e856b9ca66b4bfb.webm?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/3a74ece811f601316e856b9ca66b4bfb.mp4?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROCKET</h2>Boost yourself in any of the six directions<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/cd8624fd4547dbdacacb40ab6d96dc1c.poster.avif?t=1676154409\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/cd8624fd4547dbdacacb40ab6d96dc1c.webm?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/cd8624fd4547dbdacacb40ab6d96dc1c.mp4?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOMB</h2>Blast the obstacles and advance in level<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/2f4be6185397c02f7b32687a3cfaf4b7.poster.avif?t=1676154409\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/2f4be6185397c02f7b32687a3cfaf4b7.webm?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/2f4be6185397c02f7b32687a3cfaf4b7.mp4?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CREATOR</h2>Create blocks at the right time and complete new challenges<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/503c20f79aa875dc4259696b11b3da90.poster.avif?t=1676154409\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/503c20f79aa875dc4259696b11b3da90.webm?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799020/extras/503c20f79aa875dc4259696b11b3da90.mp4?t=1676154409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
